    <Box style={{ background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 24px', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>访谈之前以为的需求，和访谈之后看到的需求，是两个需求</Text>
